    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY A JOYFUL AND RELAXING GAME!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/9702d36bdbd38ccba03bf54b5ca8101d.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oni's Tale tells a version of a classic Japanese story. Two Onis live in the forest, and their relationship with humans is rather complicated. Amid curiosity, obstacles, and fantastical creatures, they embark on a grand adventure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gomu is courageous but also impulsive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momo is kind but also fearful.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose Gomu or Momo as the main character of this adventure and experience the story from different perspectives!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLATFORM CHALLENGES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/b9e399da4a0918c3157e742b2bc9d1c3.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your personal and in-game skills to advance through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >QUICK TIME EVENT MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/0f4fd0c40916254c2a523e05160ecc4a.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/eebf4bdc5474be417a50cd574d09f409.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type [\ud83d\uddae] or press the right buttons [\ud83c\udfae] to collect, interact and complete puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINIGAME AND PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/354531f9d48d0385ea2260804198652a.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After collecting ingredients in each level, enjoy cooking minigames and uncover the richness of Japanese culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKILLS AND PROGRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/00e47902b984e3d0d2ef9408b05fe0f4.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new powers as you progress and reveal more of the story.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY A JOYFUL AND RELAXING GAME!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/9702d36bdbd38ccba03bf54b5ca8101d.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oni's Tale tells a version of a classic Japanese story. Two Onis live in the forest, and their relationship with humans is rather complicated. Amid curiosity, obstacles, and fantastical creatures, they embark on a grand adventure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gomu is courageous but also impulsive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momo is kind but also fearful.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose Gomu or Momo as the main character of this adventure and experience the story from different perspectives!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLATFORM CHALLENGES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/b9e399da4a0918c3157e742b2bc9d1c3.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your personal and in-game skills to advance through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >QUICK TIME EVENT MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/0f4fd0c40916254c2a523e05160ecc4a.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/eebf4bdc5474be417a50cd574d09f409.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type [\ud83d\uddae] or press the right buttons [\ud83c\udfae] to collect, interact and complete puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINIGAME AND PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/354531f9d48d0385ea2260804198652a.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After collecting ingredients in each level, enjoy cooking minigames and uncover the richness of Japanese culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKILLS AND PROGRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353400/extras/00e47902b984e3d0d2ef9408b05fe0f4.avif?t=1746629745\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new powers as you progress and reveal more of the story.</p>",
    "short_description": "Be enchanted by the Oni siblings Gomu and Momo in a 2D platforming journey through a Japanese legend filled with fantasy, challenges, and color. Press the right buttons and enjoy captivating cooking minigames in this magical anime-style tale of friendship and bravery!",
